            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "1.       “Category” and “Y Axis” fields are required.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "13.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2.       “Category” field defines columns of grid.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "13.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "3.       “Y Axis” bucket can contain several elements. Each element of “Y Axis” defines single row of grid.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "13.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "4.       The legend defines distribution of values by color. Count of boxes on the legend can be changed from 3 to 9 using property “Buckets” of the formatting panel.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "13.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "5.       Color palette of distribution can be changed using property “Colorbrewer” of the formatting panel (available values: YlGn, YlGnBu, GnBu, BuGn, PuBuGn, PuBu, BuPu, RdPu, PuRd, OrRd, YlOrRd, YlOrBr, Purples, Blues, Greens, Oranges, Reds, Greys, PuOr, BrBG, PRGn, PiYG, RdBu, RdGy, RdYlBu, Spectral, RdYlGn, Paired, Pastel1, Set1, Set3).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "13.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "6.       Color of boxes defines value.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "13.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "7.       You can see values of cells, if property “Data Labels” of the formatting panel is enabled.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Calibri",
                      "fontSize": "13.5pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
